rdered: 12\nQuantity received: 10\nDifference and action: 2 boxes short; record the shortage and notify the supplier.\nChecked by: Ms Ann Blake","rubricVersion":"oa-source-rubric-v2-2026-10-26"}]'::jsonb,false,'draft',90) on conflict(subject_id,rubric_version,paper_id) do nothing;
